            <img src="/images/pilares/pilar3.png" alt="Pilar 03" class="pilar-image" />
          </div>
          <div class="pilar-body">
            <span class="pilar-tag">Pilar 03</span>
            <h3>Ativos Estratégicos</h3>
            <p>Alimentos funcionais e compostos bioativos baseados em fisiologia real...</p>
            <div class="pilar-progress-bar">
              <div class="pilar-progress-fill"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 4 -->
        <div class="pilar-card">
          <div class="pilar-image-wrap">
            <img src="/images/pilares/pilar4.png" alt="Pilar 04" class="pilar-image" />
          </div>
          <div class="pilar-body">
            <span class="pilar-tag">Pilar 04</span>
            <h3>Casos e Desmame</h3>
            <p>Análise de casos de consultório e a conduta nutricional na retirada da medicação...</p>
            <div class="pilar-progress-bar">
              <div class="pilar-progress-fill"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. TÓPICOS EXTRAS (CHECKLIST) -->
    <section class="extras-v4-section">
      <div class="container extras-v4-grid">
        <!-- Esquerda: Chamada -->
        <div class="extras-left">
          <h2>Além disso, <br/><span class="highlight">iremos passar por:</span></h2>
        </div>
        <!-- Direita: Checklist -->
        <div>
          <ul class="extras-checklist">
            <li>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Alta nas buscas por Ozempic e Mounjaro no Brasil</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Suporte para conter os 45% de abandono de GLP-1 por colaterais</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Protocolos para evitar a perda severa de massa magra</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Manejo dietético quando o apetite zera por completo</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Estratégia de desmame que começa antes da retirada da caneta</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
